"production-composition-source":{"description":"Executable local workflow composition over the existing SQLite/CAS, dispatch and commit owners. Exact CLI regressions cover preparation, seven-step execution, absolute replay, revision-bound lifecycle, changed definitions, real Rust children and crash/no-relaunch. This is local workflow source evidence, not full autonomous research, live-model authorship, production composition or Node parity. The autonomous CLI now supplies a live clock through the existing workflow/service/sequencer/SQLite owner; expiry after preparation must retain prepared bytes without commit or relaunch, and earlier committed steps survive later expiry. Explicit local amendment and lease extension also use the same writer with live post-lock/precommit checks against the previous lease; exact replay does not reapply budget or renewal. The CLI additionally propagates SIGINT/SIGTERM through the same existing process-group supervisor and precommit checks; actual-binary tests verify worker/descendant termination, retained ambiguity, no relaunch and prepared replay. This is not automatic renewal, native-kernel preemption, escaped-process containment, remote settlement or full role parity.","files":[{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/production.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"29e9d9dea03d23265d0ccfc69e7a37331bf3e6f5","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"function","name":"run_production_service_v1"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/src/deployment.rs","role":"implementation","gitBlob":"30a871b9654490be1cc64cb4b2a755bc0bc04731","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"function","name":"verify_production_deployment_v1"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hepta-paper-service/tests/durable_service.rs","role":"test","gitBlob":"812bf17d96cdf55bdf540dd782fec368d233d049","mode":"100644","language":"rust","symbols":[{"kind":"test","name":"production_boolean_and_backend_substitution_rejected"}]},{"path":"rust/crates/hept